# format=FAST
# Fusion MS-WB670 at source 51, captured 2026-09-18 on a live bus.
#
# 130820 message id 32831 (0x803F) carries a per-zone LOUDNESS flag:
# zone (zero-based) then 0 = off, 1 = on. The id is absent from
# FUSION_STATUS_MESSAGE_ID, which jumps from 32830 to 32832.
#
# Identified by flipping the control and watching the bus. Two flips, two
# different zones, in two separate sessions:
#
#   13:59:57  zone 1 ("Saloon")   1 -> 0
#   14:15:34  zone 0 ("Doghouse") 1 -> 0
#
# Each flip emitted a single unsolicited frame for that zone alone; the
# periodic sweep (all three zones, ~50 s apart) then reported it unchanged.
# The sweeps below bracket each flip. The operator named the control while
# flipping it, so the identification does not rest on inference.
#
# The command side, FUSION_MESSAGE_ID 54 "Set Loud", was NOT observed: neither
# the Zeus SRX nor the Fusion iOS app exposes loudness, and both drive the head
# unit over Ethernet in their default configuration.
#
